<section class="home-hero">
  <div class="home-hero-text">
    <h1>Tampa Bay Fishing Charters for Whatever You Came to Catch</h1>
    <p>Maybe it's your kid's first redfish on a calm morning in the mangroves. Maybe it's a cooler of snapper and grouper off Gulf bottom, or a tarpon jumping beside the boat in July.</p>
    <p>Our team of captains fishes inshore, nearshore, offshore and the lakes near Orlando. So whatever you have in mind and whenever you can get away, one of our captains is already out there doing it.</p>
    <p><strong>Between them, that's [95+] years of fishing and [850+] five star reviews.</strong></p>
    <div><a class="btn btn-accent" href="{{ site.booking }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Reserve a Date</a></div>
    <ul class="trust"><li>10% deposit holds your date</li><li>Deposit refunded for weather</li><li>Fishing licenses covered</li></ul>
  </div>
  <div class="home-hero-img"><img src="/images/guest-redfish-mangroves.webp" alt="Guest holding a Tampa Bay redfish in front of the mangroves" fetchpriority="high" width="1400" height="1067"></div>
</section>

